  "post_content": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2014/07/IMG_2932.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px\" /></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px\"><span style=\"font-family: arial,helvetica,sans-serif\">Ay&oacute;dar ha celebrado este s&aacute;bado, 26 de julio, una nueva edici&oacute;n del Mercado Morisco con sabor agridulce, ya que la paradas se tuvieron que desmontar a las 17 horas para dar paso al entierro de Mari Carmen Solsona, una de sus impulsoras.</span></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px\"><span style=\"font-family: arial,helvetica,sans-serif\"></span></span></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/mercadomoriscoayodar14/img_2902.jpg\" alt=\"img_2902\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/mercadomoriscoayodar14/img_2903.jpg\" alt=\"img_2903\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/mercadomoriscoayodar14/img_2904.jpg\" alt=\"img_2904\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/mercadomoriscoayodar14/img_2905.jpg\" alt=\"img_2905\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/mercadomoriscoayodar14/img_2906.jpg\" alt=\"img_2906\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/mercadomoriscoayodar14/img_2907.jpg\" alt=\"img_2907\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/mercadomoriscoayodar14/img_2908.jpg\" alt=\"img_2908\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/mercadomoriscoayodar14/img_2909.jpg\" alt=\"img_2909\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://p